# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: GitHub token for the "Developer Activity" section.
#
# With a token, the contribution graph and coding streak come straight from
# GitHub's official GraphQL API, and the REST rate limit rises to 5,000/hour.
# Without a token, the site still works — it falls back to a public, no-auth
# contributions API and unauthenticated REST endpoints.
#
# Create one at https://github.com/settings/tokens
#   - Classic token with NO scopes is enough (only public data is read).
#   - Add the real value to .env.local (git-ignored) — never commit it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GITHUB_TOKEN=
